 this elegant accessory set complements a wide range of décor styles, including modern, contemporary, classic, transitional, and spa-inspired interiors. Its coordinated design creates a clean, polished look that enhances any countertop while making everyday routines more convenient. Easy to clean and maintain, the durable ceramic construction offers long-lasting beauty and dependable performance. Whether you're refreshing your own bathroom or searching for a thoughtful housewarming, wedding, bridal shower, or holiday gift, the Home Weavers 4-Piece Ceramic Bathroom Accessory Set delivers the perfect combination of style, organization, and everyday practicality, making it a beautiful addition to any home.</p>", "features": ["Includes a lotion dispenser, toothbrush holder, tumbler, and matching tray for a coordinated and organized bathroom countertop.", "Made from durable, high-quality ceramic with a smooth finish that offers long-lasting beauty and everyday functionality.", "Keeps bathroom essentials neatly arranged while adding an elegant decorative touch to vanities, sinks, and countertops.", "Perfect for storing hand soap, lotion, toothbrushes, toothpaste, makeup brushes, rinsing cups, and other daily necessities.", "Designed to blend seamlessly with modern, contemporary, farmhouse, and classic bathroom styles, making it ideal for homes and guest bathrooms alike."], "material": "Ceramic", "origin": "China", "care": "Wipe Clean", "pileHeight": "", "backing": "", "shape": "", "badge": "", "featured": false, "hidden": false, "inStock": true, "swatch": "#C9BBA6", "weight": null, "seoTitle": "", "seoDescription": "", "imageAlt": "", "basePrice": 0, "baseSalePrice": null, "skuPrefix": "", "options": [{"id": "o_color", "name": "Color", "type": "color", "values": [{"id": "cl_blue", "label": "Blue", "hex": "#8DB0CF", "images": ["", "", "", "", "", "", "", ""], "primary": 0, "video": "", "swatchImage": "https://dl.dropboxusercontent.com/scl/fi/qwaybwda95oo30dok4mqp/BLUE.JPG?