er Curtain with 12 Metal Hooks. Available in a variety of attractive colors and printed designs, this shower curtain enhances your bathroom decor and complements a wide range of interior styles, from modern and contemporary to classic and traditional. Crafted from 100% premium polyester fabric, this shower curtain is lightweight, durable, and designed for everyday use. The water-resistant material helps keep water inside the shower area, reducing splashes and helping maintain a cleaner, drier bathroom floor. Measuring 70\" x 72\" (6 ft. long), the curtain provides excellent coverage for most standard bathtubs and shower stalls. Its generous size offers enhanced privacy while creating a neat and polished appearance in your bathroom. The vibrant printed designs add decorative appeal and are designed to maintain their look through regular use and washing. For added convenience, the curtain includes 12 durable metal hooks for quick and hassle-free installation. A reinforced header provides added strength and supports reliable everyday use. Easy to care for, the shower curtain is machine washable, making maintenance simple and convenient. Perfect for master bathrooms, guest bathrooms, apartments, dorm rooms, and vacation homes, the Elmstone Decorative Printed Shower Curtain combines style, durability, and functionality to elevate your bathroom space.</p>", "features": ["Stylish Printed Design – Available in multiple colors and decorative print to complement a variety of bathroom decor styles, from modern and contemporary to classic and traditional.", "Premium 100% Polyester Fabric – Made from durable, lightweight polyester that provides long-lasting performance, a soft feel, and excellent everyday usability.", "Water-Resistant & Privacy Coverage – Helps keep water inside the shower area while providing privacy and a clean, polished look for your bathroom.", "Includes 12 Metal Hooks – Comes complete with 12 durable metal hooks for quick, secure, and hassle-free installati